@startuml
title Story 1 — SPA Initialization and Interactions
actor User
participant "Browser UI" as UI
participant "app.js (Client)" as JS
participant "Rankings API\n/ api/rankings" as RankingsAPI
note right: mock/IBGE client behind the API
User -> UI: open page
UI -> JS: load()
JS -> RankingsAPI: GET /api/rankings?sex=all&state=BR
RankingsAPI --> JS: 200 Top10 (mock)
JS -> UI: render Top10
JS -> RankingsAPI: GET /api/rankings/states
RankingsAPI --> JS: 200 states list
JS -> UI: render states dropdown
User -> UI: interact (filters/search)
UI -> JS: apply filter (no page reload)
@enduml
